# Growth Funnel Audit Command

When the user says **"run growth audit"**, **"growth audit"**, **"run funnel audit"**, or **"run activation audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/growth-funnel-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/growth-funnel/YYYY-MM-DD-growth-funnel-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/growth-funnel-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/growth-funnel/`
